<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Asignar Correlativas - Sistema Académico</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        mainbg: '#dcd8d1',
                        cardpanel: '#cecbc2',
                        cardbg: '#ebe8e1',
                        uniblue: '#3b5a82',
                        unired: '#932c35'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-mainbg flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4 font-sans">

    <div class="bg-cardpanel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-4xl border border-gray-300/50">
        
        <div class="bg-cardbg p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-white/50">
            
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full mb-4 shadow-sm text-2xl">
                    🔗
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-800 tracking-tight">Paso 1: Configurar Correlativas</h1>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 text-sm">Definí los requisitos previos para cursar y rendir esta materia</p>
            </div>

            <form action="/plan-subject/correlatives" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
                <input type="hidden" name="program_id" value="{{program_id}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="plan_subject_id" value="{{plan_subject_id}}">

                <div class="h-96 overflow-y-auto border border-gray-400/40 rounded-xl shadow-inner bg-[#e3dfd6]">
                    <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
                        <thead class="bg-white/80 sticky top-0 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm z-10 border-b border-gray-300">
                            <tr>
                                <th class="p-4 font-extrabold text-gray-800 rounded-tl-xl">Materia</th>
                                <th class="p-4 font-extrabold text-gray-800">Para Cursar</th>
                                <th class="p-4 font-extrabold text-gray-800 rounded-tr-xl">Para Rendir Final</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-300/50">
                            {{#subjects}}
                            <tr class="hover:bg-white/50 transition-colors duration-150">
                                <td class="p-4 font-medium text-gray-800">{{name}}</td>
                                <td class="p-4">
                                    <select name="cursar_{{id}}" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-uniblue bg-white/90 text-gray-800 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                                        <option value="NONE">Ninguno</option>
                                        <option value="REGULAR">Regular</option>
                                        <option value="APROBADA">Aprobada</option>
                                    </select>
                                </td>
                                <td class="p-4">
                                    <select name="rendir_{{id}}" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-uniblue bg-white/90 text-gray-800 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                                        <option value="NONE">Ninguno</option>
                                        <option value="REGULAR">Regular</option>
                                        <option value="APROBADA">Aprobada</option>
                                    </select>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            {{/subjects}}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <div class="pt-2">
                    <button type="submit" 
                            class="w-full bg-uniblue text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:bg-blue-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-uniblue focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-cardbg transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        Guardar Correlativas
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>